# The build context is the repository root (the client needs packages/ui), so this
# file lists only what the image uses (IngestIQ, and the portal, InsightIQ and Settings it serves) and leaves everything else out.
# Docker reads it because it sits next to the Dockerfile with the same name.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!packages/ui
!products/ingestiq/client
!products/ingestiq/server
!products/portal/client
!products/insightiq/client
!products/settings/client
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.DS_Store
products/ingestiq/server/tests
products/ingestiq/server/spark-warehouse
